/T (This study is a part of a research series conducted to design a sustainable energy- harvesting fairway. This research proposes a semi-public energy-harvesting stairway which is designed to he used by the public and to be placed both outdoor and indoor. It could be installed inside lecture halls, hotels, footbridges and etc. This characteristic has been included incorporated into the stairway's whole design and product specifications. After this study had been conducted, a mock-up was created and tested to gain knowledge in terms of electrical input, output, and the chronological process in producing electricity. )
