/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 377 0 R
/T (Japan has already started experimenting the use of piezoelectric effect for energy generation. They implement piezoelectric effect on the stairs of the bus. Thus, every time passenger steps on the tiles; they trigger a small vibration that can be stored as energy. )
/E (Japan has already started experimenting the use of piezoelectric effect for energy generation. They implement piezoelectric effect on the stairs of the bus. Thus, every time passenger steps on the tiles; they trigger a small vibration that can be stored as energy. )
/Pg 71 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1581 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 377 0 R
/T (The flooring tiles are made up of rubber which can absorb the vibration. This vibration generates when running or walking on it. Under these tiles piezoelectric material is placed. When the movement is felt by the material, they can generate the electricity. This generated energy simultaneously stored into the battery. Generated electricity we can use the lightning of lamp or street light. Energy is generated by step of one human being is too less but if number of steps increases ultimately energy production also increases. )
/E (The flooring tiles are made up of rubber which can absorb the vibration. This vibration generates when running or walking on it. Under these tiles piezoelectric material is placed. When the movement is felt by the material, they can generate the electricity. This generated energy simultaneously stored into the battery. Generated electricity we can use the lightning of lamp or street light. Energy is generated by step of one human being is too less but if number of steps increases ultimately energy production also increases. )
/Pg 71 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
1582 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 377 0 R
/T (A piezo tile capable of generating 12V has been devised. it was established that series- parallel combination connection is more suitable. The weight which is applied to the piezoelectric tile and corresponding voltage generated is studied and they are found to have a linear relation. It is especially suited for implementation in crowded areas. This can be used in street lighting without the use of long power lines. It can also be used as charging ports, a lighting of pavement side buildings. )
/E (A piezo tile capable of generating 12V has been devised. it was established that series- parallel combination connection is more suitable. The weight which is applied to the piezoelectric tile and corresponding voltage generated is studied and they are found to have a linear relation. It is especially suited for implementation in crowded areas. This can be used in street lighting without the use of long power lines. It can also be used as charging ports, a lighting of pavement side buildings. )
