/Title (fuels, there is an urgent need for innovative, sustainable, and eco-friendly energy solutions. This project focuses on the development of a Smart Footstep Power Generation System that utilizes the piezoelectric effect to harness wasted mechanical energy from human locomotion and convert it into usable electrical energy.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 3139 0 R
/Next 3143 0 R
>>
endobj
